        "suggestion": "补充 header 或修改 headerRelation 为 null，使 section 内部层级符合微码规范。"
      },
      {
        "level": "warning",
        "type": "performance",
        "location": "layout.sections[*].body.backgroundImage",
        "message": "三个 section 的 body 均重复引用同一背景图 bg-8788.png，并分别设置 backgroundSize/Position/Repeat，导致不必要的资源绘制和性能损耗。",
        "suggestion": "将背景图提升到最外层容器统一设置，避免每个 section 重复加载和渲染背景。"
      },
      {
        "level": "warning",
